          "text": 8378,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "The museum collects stories of Camden's people, places, heritage and creativity. It presents a wide range of exhibits from art, statues and memorials, music, fashion and activism to stories from our estates and neighbourhoods. We celebrate unique people who have contributed to Camden's diverse and important history and society. We uncover hidden stories that may have been overlooked. We also delve into stories that may be contested or challenging in order to present balanced and reflective narratives.",
