        },
        "After wide consultation with residents, the culture sector, artists and stakeholders, Camden Council is pleased to share the Love Camden Cultural Strategy for 2026-2031.",
        [
          8926
        ],
        {
          "type": 8374
        },
        {
          "type": 8928
        },
        "hard_break",
        {
          "type": 8928
        },
        {
          "text": 8931,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "Culture matters. It makes people feel joyous, happier, inspired and healthier; it provides a sense of identity for residents, communities and places. ",
        {
          "type": 8367,
          "attrs": 8933,
          "content": 8934
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          8935
        ],
        {
          "text": 8936,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "Culture makes Camden and we have an ambitious vision and plan for the future of culture in our borough. ",
        {
          "type": 8367,
          "attrs": 8938,
          "content": 8939
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          8940
        ],
        {
          "text": 8941,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "The new Cultural Strategy is designed to benefit the people, organisations and businesses who are here now and those who will be here in the future.  ",
