        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          9214
        ],
        {
          "text": 9215,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "One of the highlights of the evening was poetry from the Camden Young Writers Collective, supported by the Cultural Education and Learning Support Fund.",
        {
          "type": 8367,
          "attrs": 9217,
          "content": 9218
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          9219,
          9221,
          9225
        ],
        {
          "text": 9220,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "Introduced by Natasha Ryan from ",
        {
          "text": 9222,
          "type": 8371,
          "marks": 9223
        },
        "The Poetry Society",
        [
          9224
        ],
        {
          "type": 8374
        },
        {
          "text": 9226,
          "type": 8371
        },
        ", the performances from Eloise Wainwright and Aya Elgool were moving, confident and electric. A reminder that Camden’s future cultural leaders are already here - and they are extraordinary.",
        {
          "type": 8367,
          "attrs": 9228,
          "content": 9229
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          9230
        ],
        {
          "text": 9231,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "There’s something special about hearing young writers speak their truth in a room full of decision-makers. You could have heard a pin drop during these inspiring performances.",
