        "1e8cb4be-4efa-4293-8e75-da17db1c9074",
        {
          "text": 9290,
          "type": 8371
        },
        " was another key moment — a celebration of local pride and neighbourhood creativity.",
        {
          "type": 8367,
          "attrs": 9292,
          "content": 9293
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          9294
        ],
        {
          "text": 9295,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "Our host Sami shared words from Love Camden Advisor and Chair of the Friends of Kilburn Grange Park Ajay Kumble, who reminded us that culture doesn’t just happen in venues, it lives in parks, high streets and everyday interactions.",
        {
          "type": 8367,
          "attrs": 9297,
          "content": 9298
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          9299
        ],
        {
          "text": 9300,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "And that every neighbourhood, from Kilburn to Kentish Town to Holborn, has a light of its own.",
        {
          "type": 8384,
          "attrs": 9302,
          "content": 9303
        },
        {
          "level": 9145,
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          9304
        ],
        {
          "text": 9305,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "🎶 Ending on a High",
        {
          "type": 8367,
          "attrs": 9307,
          "content": 9308
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          9309
        ],
        {
          "text": 9310,
          "type": 8371
        },
        "We closed with DJs from HvH Arts, light bites circulating, conversations flowing, and a pledge wall filling up with commitments for Camden’s cultural future.",
        {
          "type": 8367,
          "attrs": 9312,
          "content": 9313
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 27
        },
        [
          9314,
          9316,
          9317
        ],
        {
          "text": 9315,
          "type": 8371
        },
